{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_047_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1a61c58229dea7aa4b8f3d14904c08295c4309082964e0ed721bacaa2892b427",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_23:5_01_047_23_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:643d0c3881b7f358780162ab8c115f9b1b27f024b728a478bec76d29abab1989",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー。你已经回来啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_23:5_01_047_23_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8b8e0d9fb6f12fc95cc30f5b42c4d8907e4b777d88d7e02e3d87a1643772dc1",
      "text": "刚才我把巧克力分发给事务所的大家了。\n饱含着平日里的感谢，嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_23:5_01_047_23_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e7f9dad80699b9177dff25ba4b9bfa3c7e291a3dda259972efad26948019ed4",
      "text": "然后……给。这是你的那份。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_23:5_01_047_23_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81b9fda6ac29e92ce7100223c8bdff6b18b47dd85e0dd83487b483e584376331",
      "text": "顺便说一下这是纯手工制作的特别式样。\n要好好珍惜着吃哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_23:5_01_047_23_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:227ec5e7bd8d5c5b23b63116aafd3ae606e866a6de3f60afd5d0f787caff3063",
      "text": "非常感谢，秀先生！\n居然是纯手作的，真厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_23:5_01_047_23_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4727ea8d43eadb60594235587d4a12ded2912e9ca1259d87f5335251bca4eca",
      "text": "嗯。不是有那种给初学者用的手作材料包嘛？\n我试着用了那个，不过对我来说还是太简单了点啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_23:5_01_047_23_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d728368d944aa0640892f86b774e86ffe57db09c86808ff995aa5307b2b3ceb",
      "text": "原来如此，是用初学者手作材料包啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_23:5_01_047_23_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3f85084ccb5f2e63cd7c9c4a6649f96dc30e0c750647c612b7947601ecff8b2",
      "text": "干……干嘛啦。\n那种细节没必要特意去吐槽吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_23:5_01_047_23_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dba78e67e5615f07b99fbd48405632c486927b85970f275f5362b654018d0d9",
      "text": "毕竟是要做给人吃的东西啊。\n正因为是天才，才更应该做出稳妥坚实的判断吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_23:5_01_047_23_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afb8befb6c1bf587a20b69425cb9a46e8ccdf2b0c1d531f07c1f192a8f1050d3",
      "text": "还说了挺神气的话，既然我们双方都送了巧克力\n算双赢（Win-Win），那白色情人节的回礼就免了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
